{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_15","type":"agent_message","text":"The release-candidate MCP exposes `scaffold_plan`, so I used it with `framework=vite`, `starter=dashboard`, the task name, and the benchmark preset. The plan resolved to the analytics `dashboard-02` block plus four chart variants, the logic2b theme, UI dependencies, and a fully pinned Vite/React toolchain. I’m applying those exact file writes now."}}
